  "description": "Makita XRJ01Z 18V LXT Lithium-Ion Compact Cordless Reciprocating Saw (Tool Only) The Makita XRJ01 and XRJ01Z have a variable speed (0-3,000 strokes per minute) combined with a stroke length of 1/2\" for a faster, more efficient cut. Makita exclusive dual position on/off switch allows paddle or trigger operation. The \"tool-free\" blade change system allows faster blade installation and removal for increased productivity. It has a compact design of 39.5 cm long; weighs only 1.8 kg. for convenient use. Built-in LED light illuminates the work area. The soft rubberized handle provides increased comfort at work. It is ideal for a wide range of cutting applications. The LXT lithium-ion battery provides longer runtime, 5 times lower self-discharge (for use at any time) and 16 solid contact terminals (for constant high power). The Rapid Optimum 30-minute charger communicates with the battery's built-in chip throughout the charging process to maximize battery life by actively controlling current, voltage and temperature. The Rapid Optimum 30-minute charger features a built-in fan to cool the battery and produce more work for life. The charger has been awarded the ENERGY STAR seal to meet strict energy efficiency guidelines set by the US. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) and US Department of Energy (DOE). It has a 3 year warranty on the 1 year tool on the battery and charger. Sold as a bare tool. Note: Battery and charger are not included with this product",
